.TH fedora-review-digest 1 2026-08-11 "sandogasa 0.19.2" "Sandogasa Manual"
.SH NAME
fedora\-review\-digest \- Condense a fedora\-review run of an auto\-generated spec into a review comment
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfedora\-review\-digest\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-comment\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-reviews\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-net\fR] [\fB\-\-post\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIDIR\-OR\-BUGID\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Condense a fedora\-review run of an auto\-generated spec into a review comment
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-comment\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Reviewer note placed above the review ("LGTM!")
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Accept inferred checklist marks without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-reviews\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]
Base directory for bug\-id lookup
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-net\fR
Skip the crates.io latest\-version check
.TP
\fB\-\-post\fR
Post to Bugzilla: comment, review flag, claim
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIDIR\-OR\-BUGID\fR]
fedora\-review result dir, or a bug id under \-\-reviews\-dir
.SH COMMANDS
.SS fedora-review-digest config
\fBfedora\-review\-digest config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.PP
Set up or verify the Bugzilla API key used by `\-\-post`
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SS fedora-review-digest run
\fBfedora\-review\-digest run\fR [\fB\-\-copr\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-m\fR|\fB\-\-mock\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-mock\-option\fR] [\fB\-\-uniqueext\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-digest\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-comment\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-reviews\-dir\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-net\fR] [\fB\-\-post\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBUGID\fR> 
.PP
Run fedora\-review on a bug, then digest the result
.TP
\fB\-\-copr\fR \fI<OWNER/PROJECT>\fR
COPR(s) with staged deps (owner/project; CSV ok)
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<URL>\fR
Extra repo baseurl(s) to build against (CSV ok)
.TP
\fB\-m\fR, \fB\-\-mock\-config\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Mock config; doubles as the COPR chroot name
.TP
\fB\-\-mock\-option\fR \fI<OPT>\fR
Extra mock option(s), appended to fedora\-review \-o
.TP
\fB\-\-uniqueext\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Unique mock buildroot suffix (mock \-\-uniqueext)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Print the fedora\-review command without running it
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-digest\fR
Stop after the fedora\-review build (skip digest)
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-comment\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Reviewer note placed above the review ("LGTM!")
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Accept inferred checklist marks without prompting
.TP
\fB\-\-reviews\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR [default: .]
Base directory for bug\-id lookup
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-net\fR
Skip the crates.io latest\-version check
.TP
\fB\-\-post\fR
Post to Bugzilla: comment, review flag, claim
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBUGID\fR>
Review\-request Bugzilla bug id (fedora\-review \-b)
